        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Come to mention it, Missy, does this MC seem familiar to you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Hm? Now that you say it, it's like I really have seen them somewhere before."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Mmm. I feel like I've seen her somewhere, too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "She's D.D.D., you know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "D.D.D.? Oh, now I remember. She's that real famous DJ, right? I saw a poster once."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "What's she doing here as a presenter, huh."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Mm? Wait... Sideroca? What are you doing here? Out on a mission?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_206_1#8",
            "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "You could say that. It was a mission in Bol\u00edvar, helping Eyjafjalla with some geological research on the side. We heard there was a city here, and once we were all done, we put in for a vacation here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "How about you? Came with Ch'en?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "No, we came for a different reason."
